{
  "schema_version": "1.1",
  "dataset_name": "soft_tissue_sarcoma_IDC",
  "description": "soft_tissue_sarcoma_IDC: soft_tissue_sarcoma_gtv_contouring (segmentation, CT, 2D)。样本 0-19 取 random.txt 顺序前 20 个 case，source_stem 由 9 模型多数票确定。",
